  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D506%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20190602192334&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile298.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A810385CF3D69E34CC87')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_zip_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 방탈출게임(전화번호).zip</a></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">방탈출 게임 - 전화번호를 맞춰라<br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline; float: none; font-family: &amp;quot;맑은 고딕&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">예) 1부터 100을 더한 값은? 답:5050 입력후 통화 버튼 누르기</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">요즘 유행하는 방탈출게임을 수업에 응용해 보았다.</p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"380\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile6.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F990C7E4E5CF39EB5351CF0\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\"></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">수업시간에 프로그램을 실행시키고 문제를 출제한다.<br>개인이나 모둠별로 문제를 풀고, 정답을 조합해서 나온 전화번호를 찾아내어 앞에 나와 컴퓨터에서 입력하면 성공여부를 확인할 수 있다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">전화번호를 입력하여 성공한 경우 성공메시지를 보여주면서 보상해 주거나, 다음단계의 추가문제(또다른 문제지)를 풀게 할 수도 있다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">전화번호나 성공메시지는 data 텍스트 화일에 수업과 관련된 내용으로 미리 입력하고 저장하면 된다.<br>(여러개 입력이 가능하므로 모둠별로 다른 전화번호가 나오게 만들수도 있다.)<br></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline; float: none; font-family: &amp;quot;맑은 고딕&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;실행방법&gt;</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">전화번호를 누르고 통화 버튼을 누르면 된다. 전화번호가 맞으면 통화음이 나면서 성공메시지가 틀리면 통화음이 나면서 실패 메시지가 나온다.<br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">처음 작동하는 전화번호 4개 : 112, 1234. 119, 5050<br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;게임모드&gt; - 게임모드에는 2가지가 있다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">1. 비밀모드&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;비밀입력에 체크를 하면 비밀모드가 활성화 된다. 비밀모드는 컴퓨터 화면이 교단선진화로 반 전체에게 공개된 상태에서 반 전체가 똑같은 문제를 푸는 경우에 사용한다.<br>입력하는 숫자가 * 표시로 나타나고, 전화번호를 맞추었을때 추가 메시지도 화면에 나타나지 않는다.<br>마우스를 이용하여 입력하면 다른 모둠에게 힌트가 될 수 있으니, 키보드의 숫자키를 이용해서 전화번호를 입력하도록 하자.</p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"377\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile6.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F9952E9455CF39ED407A71E\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 2.png\"></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">2. 일반모드</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">입력되는 숫자를 반 전체가 봐도 괜찮은 경우에 사용한다. 마우스를 이용해서 전화번호를 입력하면 된다. 아니면 모둠별 경쟁을 할때 화면이 공개되지 않는 경우에 사용한다. 컴퓨터 화면을 칠판쪽으로 돌려 놓은 상태에서 교단선진화로 화면이 나가지 않을때 사용하면 좋다. 모둠별로 문제를 풀고 전화번호를 알아낸 경우 모둠원들이 함께 나와서 전화번호를 입력하고 통화 버튼을 눌러 성공여부를 확인하면 된다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;게임운영방법&gt;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">1. 모둠별 게임 - 화면을 전체가 보는 경우(비밀모드)</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline; float: none; font-family: &amp;quot;맑은 고딕&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">2. 모둠별 게임 - 화면을 전체가 보지 못하는 경우(일반모드)</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;모둠별로 같은 문제를 출제하고 먼저 푼 모둠이 나와서 전화번호를 입력하고 통화를 눌러 본다. 기회는 1번, 실패한 모둠은 5분동안은 다시 도전할 수 없다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">3. 반 전체가 합심하여 전화번호 맞추는 게임 (일반모드)<br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">모둠별로 서로 다른 문제를 출제해서 각각의 모둠의 정답을 순서대로 조합해서 전화번호를 만든다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">기회는 딱 1번 또는 2번,&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">중간에 옆모둠에서 지원을 받아 우리모둠의 문제가 맞았는지 확인할 수 있는 시간을 주자. 그럼 자연스럽게 우리 모둠뿐만 아니라 옆모둠과도 협업을 하게 된다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">* 설계를 잘하면 수업시간에 전체가 참여하는 재미있는 게임이 가능할 듯 하다.&nbsp;</p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; 